    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Speak with Animals.</strong> You always have the Speak with Animals spell prepared, and you can cast it with any spell slots you have. Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for it (choose when you take this feat). When you cast it as a Ritual, its duration is 8 hours.</p><p><strong>Tag Team.</strong> When you take the Help action, you can switch places with a willing ally within 5 feet of yourself as part of that same action. This movement doesn’t provoke Opportunity Attacks, and you can’t use this benefit if the ally has the Incapacitated condition.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-dmZ3kHA18d6Tbv7r\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Set the duration to 8 hours when you cast Speak with Animals as a Ritual; move the tokens yourself for Tag Team.</p></section>",
